# TODO(crbug.com/423945285): figure out less restricted blockage for
# Chromium third_party/
third_party/*
!third_party/angle
!third_party/blink
!third_party/catapult
!third_party/dawn

# No AI features or AI indexing is needed for out/ dir, except the debug log
# below (gitignore-style: un-ignore each parent path segment).
out/*
!out/Debug_64/
out/Debug_64/*
!out/Debug_64/chrome_debug.log

# Log files (e.g. mini_installer_ui.log)
*.log
!out/Debug_64/chrome_debug.log
